      {
        "text": "And the king of the south shall be strong, and one of his princes; and he shall be strong above him, and have dominion; his dominion shall be a great dominion.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 47,
            "end": 50
          },
          {
            "start": 133,
            "end": 141
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 5,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Daniel 11:5",
        "book": "Daniel",
        "chapter": 11,
        "verse": 5
      },
      {
        "text": "And in the end of years they shall join themselves together; for the king’s daughter of the south shall come to the king of the north to make an agreement: but she shall not retain the power of the arm; neither shall he stand, nor his arm: but she shall be given up, and they that brought her, and he that begat her, and he that strengthened her in these times.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 349,
            "end": 354
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 6,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Daniel 11:6",
        "book": "Daniel",
        "chapter": 11,
        "verse": 6
      },
      {
        "text": "But out of a branch of her roots shall one stand up in his estate, which shall come with an army, and shall enter into the fortress of the king of the north, and shall deal against them, and shall prevail:",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 39,
            "end": 42
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 7,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Daniel 11:7",
        "book": "Daniel",
        "chapter": 11,
        "verse": 7
      },
      {
        "text": "And shall also carry captives into Egypt their gods, with their princes, and with their precious vessels of silver and of gold; and he shall continue more years than the king of the north.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 64,
            "end": 71,
            "text": "HEB molten images."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 73,
            "end": 76
          },
          {
            "start": 150,
            "end": 154
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 8,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Daniel 11:8",
        "book": "Daniel",
        "chapter": 11,
        "verse": 8
      },
      {
        "text": "So the king of the south shall come into his kingdom, and shall return into his own land.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 41,
            "end": 44
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 9,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Daniel 11:9",
        "book": "Daniel",
        "chapter": 11,
        "verse": 9
      },
      {
        "text": "But his sons shall be stirred up, and shall assemble a multitude of great forces: and one shall certainly come, and overflow, and pass through: then shall he return, and be stirred up, even to his fortress.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 86,
            "end": 89
          },
          {
            "start": 185,
            "end": 189
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 10,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Daniel 11:10",
        "book": "Daniel",
        "chapter": 11,
        "verse": 10
      },
      {
        "text": "And the king of the south shall be moved with choler, and shall come forth and fight with him, even with the king of the north: and he shall set forth a great multitude; but the multitude shall be given into his hand.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 46,
            "end": 52,
            "text": "Dan. 8:7."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 95,
            "end": 99
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 11,
        "crossReferences": [
          {
            "raw": "Dan. 8:7.",
            "prettyString": "Daniel 8:7",
            "references": [
              {
