                "entryId": "tg-flatter",
                "book": "",
                "chapters": []
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Daniel 11:21",
        "book": "Daniel",
        "chapter": 11,
        "verse": 21
      },
      {
        "text": "And with the arms of a flood shall they be overflown from before him, and shall be broken; yea, also the prince of the covenant.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 23,
            "end": 28,
            "text": "Jer. 46:7 (7–8)."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 22,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Daniel 11:22",
        "book": "Daniel",
        "chapter": 11,
        "verse": 22
      },
      {
        "text": "And after the league made with him he shall work deceitfully: for he shall come up, and shall become strong with a small people.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 21,
            "end": 25
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 23,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Daniel 11:23",
        "book": "Daniel",
        "chapter": 11,
        "verse": 23
      },
      {
        "text": "He shall enter peaceably even upon the fattest places of the province; and he shall do that which his fathers have not done, nor his fathers’ fathers; he shall scatter among them the prey, and spoil, and riches: yea, and he shall forecast his devices against the strong holds, even for a time.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 87,
            "end": 91
          },
          {
            "start": 212,
            "end": 216
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 24,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Daniel 11:24",
        "book": "Daniel",
        "chapter": 11,
        "verse": 24
      },
      {
        "text": "And he shall stir up his power and his courage against the king of the south with a great army; and the king of the south shall be stirred up to battle with a very great and mighty army; but he shall not stand: for they shall forecast devices against him.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 25,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Daniel 11:25",
        "book": "Daniel",
        "chapter": 11,
        "verse": 25
      },
      {
        "text": "Yea, they that feed of the portion of his meat shall destroy him, and his army shall overflow: and many shall fall down slain.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 26,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Daniel 11:26",
        "book": "Daniel",
        "chapter": 11,
        "verse": 26
      },
      {
        "text": "And both these kings’ hearts shall be to do mischief, and they shall speak lies at one table; but it shall not prosper: for yet the end shall be at the time appointed.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 29,
            "end": 37
          },
          {
            "start": 136,
            "end": 144
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 27,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Daniel 11:27",
        "book": "Daniel",
        "chapter": 11,
        "verse": 27
      },
      {
        "text": "Then shall he return into his land with great riches; and his heart shall be against the holy covenant; and he shall do exploits, and return to his own land.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 68,
            "end": 76
          },
          {
            "start": 120,
            "end": 129
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 28,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Daniel 11:28",
        "book": "Daniel",
        "chapter": 11,
        "verse": 28
      },
      {
        "text": "At the time appointed he shall return, and come toward the south; but it shall not be as the former, or as the latter.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 29,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Daniel 11:29",
        "book": "Daniel",
        "chapter": 11,
        "verse": 29
      },
      {
        "text": "For the ships of Chittim shall come against him: therefore he shall be grieved, and return, and have indignation against the holy covenant: so shall he do; he shall even return, and have intelligence with them that forsake the holy covenant.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 17,
            "end": 24,
            "text": "Num. 24:24."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 30,
        "crossReferences": [
