        "reference": "Daniel 11:31",
        "book": "Daniel",
        "chapter": 11,
        "verse": 31
      },
      {
        "text": "And such as do wickedly against the covenant shall he corrupt by flatteries: but the people that do know their God shall be strong, and do exploits.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 139,
            "end": 148
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 32,
        "crossReferences": [],
